<div class="compare-hero">
  <h1>Medical Tourism in Asia: China vs Thailand vs Malaysia vs Singapore — 2026 Cost Comparison</h1>
  <p>An independent, data-driven comparison for Indonesian, Bangladeshi, and Middle Eastern patients choosing where to go for surgery. Prices, wait times, and quality — side by side.</p>
</div>

<div class="compare-intro">
  <h2>Asia's Medical Tourism Landscape (2025–2026)</h2>
  <p>Over <strong>5.5 million international patients</strong> travel to Asia each year for medical treatment. Thailand and Malaysia dominate the market, but China is growing fast — with <strong>1.28 million international patient visits</strong> in 2025, China already outpaces Singapore (646K) and is closing in on Malaysia (1.6M). Here's how they actually compare.</p>
</div>

<div class="market-grid">
